[{"answer":"Hello everybody and welcome to this informal meeting about the University Helpline.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/1.mp3"},{"answer":"The Helpline was set up ten years ago by the Students Union","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and it aims to provide new students to the university","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/3.mp3"},{"answer":"with a service that they can use if they need information","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/4.mp3"},{"answer":"about practical areas of student life that they are unfamiliar with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me give you some examples of the type of help we can offer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/6.mp3"},{"answer":"We can provide information on financial matters;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/7.mp3"},{"answer":"for example, you may feel that your grant is insufficient to see you through college life","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/8.mp3"},{"answer":"or you may have some queries regarding the fees you are paying","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/9.mp3"},{"answer":"if you are an overseas student.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/10.mp3"},{"answer":"In both cases, the Helpline would be able to go through things with you","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and see what the outcome might be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Another area we can help with is what we generally term the 'domestic' area;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/13.mp3"},{"answer":"things such as childcare and the availability of nursery provision, for example, come under this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's 'academic' issues that may arise while you are in the early stages of your course","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/15.mp3"},{"answer":"that you may not know what to do about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/16.mp3"},{"answer":"You may wish to know more about essay deadlines, for example,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/17.mp3"},{"answer":"or how to use the library -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/18.mp3"},{"answer":"there are all kinds of questions you will find yourself asking","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and not knowing where to get quick answers from.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/20.mp3"},{"answer":"The Helpline would be able to provide these.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/21.mp3"},{"answer":"The last example I've given here is simply termed 'social' -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and yes, there is a lot of social life here!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/23.mp3"},{"answer":"But you may have a particular interest you wish to pursue","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/24.mp3"},{"answer":"or you may wish to participate in outings or trips","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/25.mp3"},{"answer":"if you don't know many people at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me give you some details","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/27.mp3"},{"answer":"so that you know where to go and who to see if you want to pay us a visit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Generally you will see our Helpline officer Jackie Kouachi,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/29.mp3"},{"answer":"that's KOUACHI.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Jackie is a full-time employee of the Student Union","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/31.mp3"},{"answer":"and she works in the Student Welfare Office -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/32.mp3"},{"answer":"that's the office that deals with all matters related to student welfare","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's located at 13 Marshall Road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I have some maps here for those of you who haven't been there yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/35.mp3"},{"answer":"If you wish to ring the office,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/36.mp3"},{"answer":"the number is 3269940.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/37.mp3"},{"answer":"That's 3269940.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/38.mp3"},{"answer":"The office is open between 9.30 and 6 o'clock on weekdays","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and from 10 to 4 on Saturdays","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/40.mp3"},{"answer":"and there'll be somebody there usually Jackie or myself - between those times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/41.mp3"},{"answer":"If you want to make an appointment, you can phone or call at the office in person.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Please note that it may not be possible for anyone to see you straight away -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/43.mp3"},{"answer":"particularly if it is a busy time - lunch time for example -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and you may have to go on the waiting list and then come back later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, enough from me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Any questions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-2-2023-08-15-21-27-28/47.mp3"}]
